From: "Ticky (Developer)" <ticky@dot.local>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 17:37:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] S8 reporting: folds and OOS derived proportionally from the
 loaded data by trading day, not calendar months. Six equal folds over the
 leading two-thirds, disjoint from a final-third hold-out named in dates;
 UNEVALUABLE below a 5-trading-day-per-slice floor; legacy calendar figures
 retained in contenders.csv and removed from every console and report surface

---
 dot_master_discovery/master.py | 90 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 82 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

